    enemyHealth: 1.4
    enemyPower: 1.35
    enemyDensity: 1.15
    loot: 1.1
    dropsUpToTier: 0
    briefing: Wolves pounce from a distance and bog things spit in volleys. Root Guardians wake, Moss Shamans call them on. Iron, deepstone and elderwood lie deeper in.
    eliteCount: {x: 1, y: 2}
    eliteAffixes: 1
